error[E0408]: `truncate` can't convert `f64` to `u8`
  --> tests/programs/numbers/conversions/e0408.la:2:17
  |
2 |     let a = 2.5.truncate<u8>();
  |                 ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: `truncate` keeps the low bits of an integer; from a float, write `round`, `floor`, `ceil` or `saturate`

error[E0408]: `floor` can't convert `i64` to `i64`
  --> tests/programs/numbers/conversions/e0408.la:3:15
  |
3 |     let b = 7.floor<i64>();
  |               ^^^^^
  |
  = help: `floor` and `ceil` round a float; an integer is already whole

error[E0408]: `truncate` can't convert `i64` to `bool`
  --> tests/programs/numbers/conversions/e0408.la:4:17
  |
4 |     let c = 300.truncate<bool>();
  |                 ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: `truncate` keeps the low bits of an integer; from a float, write `round`, `floor`, `ceil` or `saturate`

